{"seq":82,"slug":"julia-scientific-computing","title":"Julia 科学计算","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Julia 科学计算\n\nJulia 由 MIT 于 2012 年公开发布，设计初衷是终结科学计算领域的「两语言问题」——研究者不再需要先用 Python 做原型、再用 C++ 重写以获得性能。凭借 LLVM 即时编译与多重派发机制，Julia 在保持动态语言交互便利性的同时，达到了接近 C/Fortran 的运行速度。截至 2026 年，Julia 已发布 1.12 版本，注册包超过 11000 个，在微分方程求解、数学优化、GPU 加速等领域形成了世界领先的生态系统。\n\n本 hub 面向已有编程基础（熟悉至少一门系统语言或脚本语言）的开发者，系统讲解如何用 Julia 构建高性能科学计算应用。内容组织为四条递进主线：语言基础奠定类型系统与性能心智模型；科学计算核心覆盖数值代数、微分方程与优化三大支柱；数据与可视化展示从数据加载到统计建模再到出版级绑图的完整链路；高性能与部署探讨并行、GPU 及跨语言互操作的工程实践。四条主线依次递进，前一条为后一条提供概念基础。\n\n与本仓库兄弟 hub 的分工：rust-language 聚焦系统编程与内存安全，python-advanced 侧重 Python 高级特性与工程实践——两者都不涉及科学计算生态的深度整合。本 hub 独占 Julia 类型系统、SciML 生态、JuMP 优化框架、Makie 可视化等主题。\n\n推荐学习路径：先通读第一章建立类型系统与性能模型的认知，再根据实际需求选择科学计算核心中的任一方向深入，之后在数据与可视化章节实践端到端的分析流程，最后学习高性能章节以应对大规模计算场景。\n\n前置知识：线性代数基础（矩阵运算、特征值）、微积分（导数、积分）、至少一门编程语言的使用经验。不要求事先了解 Julia 语法——第一章会从类型系统讲起。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"Julia 语言基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-system-multiple-dispatch","title":"类型系统与多重派发","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/foundations/type-system-multiple-dispatch"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-model-optimization","title":"性能模型与优化","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/foundations/performance-model-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metaprogramming-macros","title":"元编程与宏系统","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/foundations/metaprogramming-macros"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"scientific-core","title":"科学计算核心","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/scientific-core","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"numerical-linear-algebra","title":"数值线性代数与矩阵计算","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/scientific-core/numerical-linear-algebra"},{"seq":2,"slug":"differential-equations","title":"微分方程求解","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/scientific-core/differential-equations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization-mathematical-programming","title":"优化与数学规划","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/scientific-core/optimization-mathematical-programming"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-visualization","title":"数据与可视化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/data-visualization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dataframes-processing","title":"数据处理与 DataFrames","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/data-visualization/dataframes-processing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"statistical-analysis","title":"统计分析与概率编程","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/data-visualization/statistical-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"plotting-ecosystem","title":"可视化与绘图生态","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/data-visualization/plotting-ecosystem"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"high-performance","title":"高性能与部署","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/high-performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-distributed-computing","title":"并行与分布式计算","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/high-performance/parallel-distributed-computing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gpu-computing-cuda","title":"GPU 计算与 CUDA.jl","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/high-performance/gpu-computing-cuda"},{"seq":3,"slug":"interop-python-c","title":"与 Python 和 C 互操作","url":"/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/high-performance/interop-python-c"}]}]}